    "home-site-citadelle-body": "The largest fortress in the Western Hemisphere. Built by formerly enslaved people who had just defeated Napoleon's army. Following the tragedy of April 11, 2026, Levoila's first act here is a permanent memorial — then full restoration, professional security, and certified tours.",
