    "dispatches-featured-label": "FEATURED  ·  FOUNDER",
    "dispatches-featured-h2": "From the library at 18 to the Citadelle at 50.",
    "dispatches-featured-body": "The first library I walked into changed me. The last fortress I will walk into will be the one we leave standing. Between those two doors is the life I was given. This is what I did with it.",
    "dispatches-featured-meta": "By Jacques Medina Jean  ·  May 10, 2026  ·  6 min read",
    "dispatches-featured-read": "Read the dispatch →",
    "dispatches-photo-title-citadelle-dawn": "The Citadelle at Dawn",
